{% extends "_layout.html.j2" %}
{% block body %}
<p>Effective: {{ f('effective_date') }}</p>
<h2>1. Agreement</h2>
<p>These terms govern your use of {{ f('app_title') }} ({{ f('site_url') }}), provided by {{ f('legal_name') }}
({{ f('postal_address') }}). By using the service you agree to them. If you do not agree, please do not use it.</p>
<h2>2. Your account</h2>
<p>{% if accounts %}You sign in through our shared login service. Keep your credentials private and tell us at
{{ f('support_email') }} if you think someone else has used your account. You can delete your account yourself at any time
from your account page.{% else %}{{ f('app_title') }} does not require an account.{% endif %}</p>
<h2>3. Acceptable use</h2>
<p>Do not misuse the service: no attempts to break, overload or probe it, no unlawful content, and no use that harms other people.
We may suspend access that breaks these rules.</p>
{% if sells_goods or subscriptions %}
<h2>4. Purchases</h2>
<p>Prices and what you receive are shown before you pay. Payments are handled by {{ f('payment_processor') }}; we never see your full card
number. See our <a href="{{ base_path }}/refunds.html">refund, return and cancellation policy</a>.</p>
{% endif %}
<h2>{% if sells_goods or subscriptions %}5{% else %}4{% endif %}. Service changes and availability</h2>
<p>We aim to keep the service running but do not promise it will be uninterrupted or error-free. We may change or end features, and will
give notice where reasonably possible.</p>
<h2>{% if sells_goods or subscriptions %}6{% else %}5{% endif %}. Disclaimers and limits</h2>
<p>The service is provided &ldquo;as is&rdquo;, without warranties to the extent the law allows. To the extent the law allows, our total
liability to you is limited to the amount you paid us in the 12 months before the claim. Nothing here limits rights you have under law
that cannot be limited.</p>
<h2>{% if sells_goods or subscriptions %}7{% else %}6{% endif %}. Governing law</h2>
<p>These terms are governed by {{ f('governing_law') }}.</p>
<h2>{% if sells_goods or subscriptions %}8{% else %}7{% endif %}. Changes to these terms</h2>
<p>We may update these terms. The effective date above shows the latest version; continued use means you accept the update.</p>
<h2>Contact</h2>
<p>Questions: <a href="mailto:{{ f('support_email') }}">{{ f('support_email') }}</a> or the <a href="{{ base_path }}/contact.html">contact page</a>.</p>
{% endblock %}
